# Corridor of the first-person view preview (Options > Game).
#
# Engine world units and axes: X into the distance, Y to the left, Z up, floor at Z = 0 with
# the camera 48 above it. Each usemtl names a WAD texture (cs_dust, cstrike, halflife). Faces
# are lit by their face normals, which the loader derives from the winding, so no normals or
# shading are stored here; ncl_preview_scene_reload reads the file again.

o floor
v -160 96 0
v -160 -96 0
v 1000 -96 0
v 1000 96 0
vt 0 1
vt 1 1
vt 1 -5.0417
vt 0 -5.0417
usemtl SandRoad
f 1/1 2/2 3/3 4/4

